{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52526","headline":"旋师之什 · 陈元光","name":"旋师之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪尽青山昏，师旋赤眉至。\n皇天监有光，边帅却非义。\n六月张貔貅，万弓发羊豕。\n海岳皆效灵，苗民悉循纪。\n卷舒如祥云，进止若时雨。\n薄暮天爲阴，衔枚肃我旅。\n一火空巢窝，羣凶相籍死。\n《采芑》歌言旋，记此非黩武。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}